** 1. Introduction

--- CréerEnvironnementOpam
  SetWorkingDirectory : .

  > opam switch create calame ocaml-base-compiler.5.2.1

  > opam switch set calame
  > eval $(opam env)
--- End CréerEnvironnementOpam

--- VérificationOcaml
  > which ocaml
  >> [something]/.opam/calame/bin/ocaml
 
  > ocaml --version
  >> The OCaml toplevel, version 5.2.1
--- End VérificationOcaml

--- VérificationDune
  > opam install dune

  > which dune
  >> [something]/.opam/calame/bin/dune

  > dune --version
  >> 3.20.2
--- End VérificationDune

--- DéclarationProjetDune
  > dune init proj calame .
  >> Success: initialized project component named calame

  ### EDIT dune-project
  +(lang dune 3.20)

  +(name calame)

  +(generate_opam_files true)
  ### End EDIT
--- End DéclarationProjetDune

--- VérificationInitialisationProjet
  > dune build
  >>
  > dune exec bin/main.exe
  >> Hello, World!
--- End VérificationInitialisationProjet

--- ÉlagageArbreProjet
  > dune clean
  > rm -rf bin
  > rm -rf test
  > tree -L 3
  >>. 
    ├── MakeLog.log
    ├── calame.opam
    ├── dune-project
    └── lib
	└── dune

	2 directories, 4 files
--- End ÉlagageArbreProjet

--- InitialisationLocaleGit
  > git init
  >> Initialized empty Git repository in [something]/calame/.git/
  > git status
  >> [...]

  ### EDIT .gitignore
  +_build/
  +.opam-switch/
  +*.install
  ### End EDIT

  > git add .
  > git commit -m "Initial Calame skeleton (environement, opam, Makelog)"
--- End InitialisationLocaleGit

